{
 "SWE-Ladder: Localize, Reproduce, then Patch · REAL Lab Blog": "SWE-Ladder：先定位，再复现，最后修复 · REAL Lab 博客",
 "SWE-Ladder shows a frozen teacher only the slice of the verified repair that the current stage needs, and introduces localization, reproduction and patching in repair order. Qwen3-4B on SWE-bench Verified: 9.6% → 16.4% pass@1.": "SWE-Ladder 只把已验证修复中当前阶段需要的那部分交给冻结的教师模型，并按修复顺序依次引入定位、复现和修复三个阶段。Qwen3-4B 在 SWE-bench Verified 上的 pass@1 从 9.6% 提升到 16.4%。",
 "SWE-Ladder: Learning to Localize, Reproduce, and Patch via Progressive Privileged Self-Distillation": "SWE-Ladder：通过渐进式特权自蒸馏学习定位、复现与修复",
 "Show the teacher only what the current repair stage needs, one stage at a time: 9.6% → 16.4% pass@1 on SWE-bench Verified with a 4B model.": "每次只给教师看当前修复阶段需要的信息，逐个阶段训练：4B 模型在 SWE-bench Verified 上的 pass@1 从 9.6% 提升到 16.4%。",
 "<a href=\"../../blog.html\">Blog</a><span class=\"dot\"></span><span>November 15, 2026</span><span class=\"dot\"></span><span>Code agents · Reinforcement learning</span><span class=\"dot\"></span><span>12 min read</span>": "<a href=\"../../blog.html\">博客</a><span class=\"dot\"></span><span>2026 年 11 月 15 日</span><span class=\"dot\"></span><span>代码智能体 · 强化学习</span><span class=\"dot\"></span><span>阅读约 12 分钟</span>",
 "A software-engineering agent has to find the bug, reproduce it and fix it, but its training signal usually comes from one test result at the end. SWE-Ladder gives a frozen teacher only the slice of the verified repair that the current stage needs, and climbs the stages in repair order.": "软件工程智能体要找到 bug、复现 bug、再修复它，但训练信号通常只有最后的一次测试结果。SWE-Ladder 只把已验证修复中与当前阶段相关的部分交给冻结的教师模型，并按修复的先后顺序逐级训练各个阶段。",
 "<sup>1</sup>Zhejiang University": "<sup>1</sup>浙江大学",
 "<a class=\"pill-btn solid\" href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.33667\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M14 3H7a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h10a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z\"></path><path d=\"M14 3v5h5M9 13h6M9 17h6\"></path></svg>Paper</a> <a class=\"pill-btn\" href=\"https://github.com/ZJU-REAL/SWE-Ladder\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m8 8-4 4 4 4M16 8l4 4-4 4\"></path></svg>Code</a> <a class=\"pill-btn\" href=\"https://zjureal.com/SWE-Ladder/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\"></circle><path d=\"M3 12h18M12 3a14 14 0 0 1 0 18M12 3a14 14 0 0 0 0 18\"></path></svg>Project page</a>": "<a class=\"pill-btn solid\" href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.33667\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M14 3H7a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h10a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z\"></path><path d=\"M14 3v5h5M9 13h6M9 17h6\"></path></svg>论文</a> <a class=\"pill-btn\" href=\"https://github.com/ZJU-REAL/SWE-Ladder\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m8 8-4 4 4 4M16 8l4 4-4 4\"></path></svg>代码</a> <a class=\"pill-btn\" href=\"https://zjureal.com/SWE-Ladder/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\"></circle><path d=\"M3 12h18M12 3a14 14 0 0 1 0 18M12 3a14 14 0 0 0 0 18\"></path></svg>项目主页</a>",
 "<a href=\"#problem\"><span class=\"n\">1</span>What one reward misses</a>": "<a href=\"#problem\"><span class=\"n\">1</span>单一奖励的不足</a>",
 "<a href=\"#router\">Routing steps to stages</a>": "<a href=\"#router\">把每一步分到对应阶段</a>",
 "<a href=\"#evidence\">Stage-specific evidence</a>": "<a href=\"#evidence\">分阶段的证据</a>",
 "<a href=\"#schedule\">Climbing in repair order</a>": "<a href=\"#schedule\">按修复顺序逐级训练</a>",
 "<a href=\"#climb\"><span class=\"n\">4</span>Along the ladder</a>": "<a href=\"#climb\"><span class=\"n\">4</span>逐级训练中的变化</a>",
 "<a href=\"#ablations\"><span class=\"n\">5</span>What matters</a>": "<a href=\"#ablations\"><span class=\"n\">5</span>哪些设计起作用</a>",
 "<a href=\"#dynamics\"><span class=\"n\">6</span>Training dynamics</a>": "<a href=\"#dynamics\"><span class=\"n\">6</span>训练动态</a>",
 "<a href=\"#problem\">What one reward misses</a>": "<a href=\"#problem\">单一奖励的不足</a>",
 "<a href=\"#climb\">Along the ladder</a>": "<a href=\"#climb\">逐级训练中的变化</a>",
 "<a href=\"#dynamics\">Training dynamics</a>": "<a href=\"#dynamics\">训练动态</a>",
 "Resolving a repository issue takes three skills: <span class=\"st-loc\">localize</span> the faulty code, <span class=\"st-rep\">reproduce</span> the failure, and <span class=\"st-patch\">patch</span> the code. Reinforcement learning trains all three from a single test result on the final patch. On-policy self-distillation adds a teacher that sees privileged evidence, but in practice it is shown the full reference patch at every step, which tells it <em>what</em> to change even while the agent is still working out <em>where</em> to look.": "解决一个代码仓库 issue 需要三种能力：<span class=\"st-loc\">定位</span>出错的代码，<span class=\"st-rep\">复现</span>故障，再给代码<span class=\"st-patch\">打补丁</span>。强化学习只凭最终补丁的一次测试结果，同时训练这三种能力。On-policy 自蒸馏引入了能看到特权证据的教师，但实际做法是每一步都把完整的参考补丁给教师看。这样，智能体还在摸索该看<em>哪里</em>，教师就已经知道该改<em>什么</em>。",
 "SWE-Ladder splits the verified repair of each training issue into three pieces of evidence: the changed files and lines for localization, the fail-to-pass tests for reproduction, and the diff for patching. A rule-based router labels every step of an end-to-end rollout with its stage from the tool call, a frozen teacher sees only the matching evidence, and the stages are distilled one at a time in repair order while GRPO keeps optimizing the whole trajectory.": "SWE-Ladder 把每个训练 issue 的已验证修复拆成三份证据：用于定位的改动文件和行号，用于复现的 fail-to-pass 测试，用于修复的 diff。基于规则的路由器根据工具调用，给端到端 rollout 的每一步标上所属阶段；冻结的教师只看到对应阶段的证据。三个阶段按修复顺序逐个蒸馏，GRPO 则始终优化整条轨迹。",
 "<strong>With Qwen3-4B-Instruct-2507 on SWE-bench Verified, SWE-Ladder raises pass@1 from 9.6% to 16.4%, against 10.4% for GRPO and 12.4% for a teacher that sees the full patch.</strong> On the OpenHands scaffold it goes from 13.0% to 17.6%, where every baseline stays at or below the base model. Reversing the stage order drops it to 11.4%.": "<strong>在 SWE-bench Verified 上，SWE-Ladder 把 Qwen3-4B-Instruct-2507 的 pass@1 从 9.6% 提升到 16.4%，GRPO 为 10.4%，看完整补丁的教师为 12.4%。</strong>在 OpenHands 框架下，SWE-Ladder 从 13.0% 提升到 17.6%，而所有基线都不高于基座模型。把阶段顺序反过来，结果降到 11.4%。",
 "<a class=\"card\" href=\"#results\"><p class=\"card-k\">SWE-bench Verified, R2E-Gym, pass@1</p><p class=\"card-t\">Beats both kinds of supervision</p><div class=\"card-chart\" data-card=\"0\"></div></a> <a class=\"card\" href=\"#results\"><p class=\"card-k\">SWE-bench Verified, OpenHands, pass@1</p><p class=\"card-t\">Holds on a second scaffold</p><div class=\"card-chart\" data-card=\"1\"></div></a> <a class=\"card\" href=\"#ablations\"><p class=\"card-k\">Training order, pass@1</p><p class=\"card-t\">The order of the rungs matters</p><div class=\"card-chart\" data-card=\"2\"></div></a> <a class=\"card\" href=\"#results\"><p class=\"card-k\">R2E-Gym, trajectories that finish</p><p class=\"card-t\">Shorter, and almost always complete</p><div class=\"card-chart\" data-card=\"3\"></div></a>": "<a class=\"card\" href=\"#results\"><p class=\"card-k\">SWE-bench Verified，R2E-Gym，pass@1</p><p class=\"card-t\">优于两类监督方式</p><div class=\"card-chart\" data-card=\"0\"></div></a> <a class=\"card\" href=\"#results\"><p class=\"card-k\">SWE-bench Verified，OpenHands，pass@1</p><p class=\"card-t\">换一个框架依然有效</p><div class=\"card-chart\" data-card=\"1\"></div></a> <a class=\"card\" href=\"#ablations\"><p class=\"card-k\">训练顺序，pass@1</p><p class=\"card-t\">阶段顺序很重要</p><div class=\"card-chart\" data-card=\"2\"></div></a> <a class=\"card\" href=\"#results\"><p class=\"card-k\">R2E-Gym，跑完的轨迹占比</p><p class=\"card-t\">步数更少，几乎都能跑完</p><div class=\"card-chart\" data-card=\"3\"></div></a>",
 "<span class=\"n\">1</span>What one reward, or one full patch, misses": "<span class=\"n\">1</span>单一奖励和完整补丁各缺什么",
 "An SWE agent edits a repository over dozens of tool calls, and the usual training signal is whether its final patch passes the designated tests. That makes it hard to tell which decision caused a failure. To see what different signals actually teach, we measure three intermediate behaviours on SWE-bench Verified alongside pass@1: whether the agent edits the files changed by the reference repair (<em>localization</em>), whether it writes and runs a script that shows the failure (<em>reproduction</em>), and whether it re-runs that script successfully after its last edit (<em>verification</em>).": "SWE 智能体要经过几十次工具调用来修改代码仓库，而常用的训练信号只是最终补丁能否通过指定测试，很难看出失败是哪个决策造成的。为了弄清不同信号到底教会了什么，我们在 SWE-bench Verified 上除了 pass@1，还统计了三种中间行为：智能体是否修改了参考修复改动过的文件（<em>定位</em>）；是否编写并运行了能复现故障的脚本（<em>复现</em>）；最后一次修改后，是否重新运行该脚本并成功通过（<em>验证</em>）。",
 "Two patterns stand out. <strong>The outcome reward does not reliably improve these behaviours:</strong> under GRPO, pass@1 barely moves, from 9.6% to 10.4%, while reproduction falls from 59.4% to 48.6%. <strong>Showing the teacher the full patch raises pass@1 but lowers post-edit verification</strong>, from 22.6% to 16.2%. During a localization step, a teacher that already sees the replacement code is pulled toward editing rather than searching; the same effect has been reported in single-turn reasoning, where a teacher conditioned on the full reference makes the student skip intermediate steps and verify less.": "结果有两点比较明显。<strong>结果奖励不能稳定提升这些行为：</strong>用 GRPO 训练后，pass@1 几乎没变，只从 9.6% 升到 10.4%，复现却从 59.4% 降到 48.6%。<strong>让教师看完整补丁能提高 pass@1，但修改后的验证变少了</strong>，从 22.6% 降到 16.2%。在定位步骤里，教师已经看到了替换后的代码，会倾向于直接改代码，而不是继续搜索。已有工作在单轮推理中报告过同样的现象：教师以完整参考答案为条件时，学生会跳过中间步骤，验证也更少。",
 "The idea": "核心想法",
 "At each step, the teacher should see only the part of the verified repair that the current stage needs, and the stages should be taught in the order a repair uses them: find the code, make the failure concrete, then fix it.": "每一步只让教师看到已验证修复中当前阶段需要的那部分；各阶段按修复时用到它们的顺序来教：先找到代码，再把故障实际复现出来，最后修复。",
 "SWE-Ladder trains a single end-to-end agent. It never constrains which tools the agent calls; it only decides which evidence the teacher sees and which tokens that teacher supervises. <a class=\"fig-ref\" href=\"#fig-1\">Figure 1</a> plays a real 21-step rollout from the paper through the router, then climbs the three phases of training.": "SWE-Ladder 训练的是一个端到端智能体。它不限制智能体调用哪些工具，只决定教师能看到哪些证据、监督哪些 token。<a class=\"fig-ref\" href=\"#fig-1\">图 1</a> 先用论文中一条真实的 21 步 rollout 演示路由器如何打标签，再依次展示三个训练阶段。",
 "Student rollout · an oauthlib issue, 21 steps, labelled by the router": "学生 rollout · 一个 oauthlib issue，共 21 步，由路由器标注阶段",
 "<span class=\"m2-test\">tests</span><span>One verifier result for the whole rollout → <b>GRPO updates every response token</b>, whatever its stage.</span>": "<span class=\"m2-test\">测试</span><span>整条 rollout 只有一个验证器结果 → <b>GRPO 更新所有回复 token</b>，不分阶段。</span>",
 "<b>Phase 3 · PATCH</b><span>iterations 51–70</span>": "<b>阶段 3 · PATCH</b><span>迭代 51–70</span>",
 "<b>Phase 2 · REP</b><span>iterations 31–50</span>": "<b>阶段 2 · REP</b><span>迭代 31–50</span>",
 "<b>Phase 1 · LOC</b><span>iterations 1–30</span>": "<b>阶段 1 · LOC</b><span>迭代 1–30</span>",
 "Frozen teacher · same base model · sees only": "冻结的教师 · 与学生同一基座模型 · 只能看到",
 "Choose a phase": "选择一个阶段",
 "Distillation mask on the rollout": "rollout 上的蒸馏掩码",
 "L = L<sub>GRPO</sub> + 0.15 · L<sub>OPSD</sub>(<span id=\"m2-loss\">active stage</span>)": "L = L<sub>GRPO</sub> + 0.15 · L<sub>OPSD</sub>(<span id=\"m2-loss\">当前阶段</span>)",
 "<b>Figure 1.</b> SWE-Ladder on one rollout. <b>Top:</b> the 21 steps of an oauthlib repair (paper Table 7), grouped as in the paper and labelled LOC, REP or PATCH by the rule-based router from each tool call. The labels are not monotone: re-running the reproduction script while patching demotes the state to REP (step 12), and a third consecutive inspection returns it to LOC (step 15). <b>Bottom:</b> the three training phases. In each phase a frozen copy of the base model sees one stage's evidence and distils only the steps with that label; GRPO still trains on every step. Evidence blocks are the schematic examples of the paper's Figure 3.": "<b>图 1.</b> SWE-Ladder 在一条 rollout 上的工作过程。<b>上：</b>一次 oauthlib 修复的 21 个步骤（论文表 7），分组方式与论文相同，基于规则的路由器根据每次工具调用把它们标为 LOC、REP 或 PATCH。标签并不单调推进：修补过程中重新运行复现脚本，状态会退回 REP（第 12 步）；连续第三次查看代码，状态又回到 LOC（第 15 步）。<b>下：</b>三个训练阶段。每个阶段里，基座模型的冻结副本只看到一个阶段的证据，也只蒸馏带该标签的步骤；GRPO 仍在所有步骤上训练。证据块取自论文图 3 的示意样例。",
 "Routing steps to stages": "把每一步分到对应阶段",
 "A deterministic, tool-level state machine labels each step. Creating or running a file whose name contains <code>repro</code>, editing a test file or running the test suite proposes <span class=\"st-rep\">REP</span>; editing any other source file proposes <span class=\"st-patch\">PATCH</span>; searches, file views and read-only shell commands are exploration. A proposal only moves the state forward in the order LOC → REP → PATCH, and backtracking depends on the state: in REP, three consecutive explorations return to LOC; in PATCH, a single test run demotes to REP and a single exploration returns to LOC. The labels only route the teacher's context and the distillation mask. They never truncate a rollout or change its reward.": "路由器是一个确定性的、工作在工具层面的状态机，给每一步打标签。创建或运行文件名含 <code>repro</code> 的文件、编辑测试文件、运行测试套件，都会提议进入 <span class=\"st-rep\">REP</span>；编辑其他源文件，提议进入 <span class=\"st-patch\">PATCH</span>；搜索、查看文件和只读的 shell 命令都算探索。提议只能让状态按 LOC → REP → PATCH 的顺序前进，回退规则则取决于当前状态：处于 REP 时，连续三次探索会回到 LOC；处于 PATCH 时，运行一次测试就退回 REP，探索一次就回到 LOC。这些标签只决定教师的上下文和蒸馏掩码，不会截断 rollout，也不改变奖励。",
 "On 2,261 held-out stage-labelled steps, the router agrees with reference labels on 92.0% of them. A learned TF-IDF classifier agrees on 98.63%, yet trains a worse agent: it predicts each step independently and fragments trajectories into isolated labels, while the stateful rules produce contiguous stage blocks.": "在 2,261 个留出的、带阶段标注的步骤上，路由器与参考标签的一致率为 92.0%。学习得到的 TF-IDF 分类器一致率达到 98.63%，训出的智能体反而更差：它对每一步独立预测，把轨迹切成零散的标签；带状态的规则则能产生连续的阶段块。",
 "Stage-specific evidence": "分阶段的证据",
 "All evidence comes from each training issue's verified repair, with nothing generated by an external model. The teacher prompts share the student's system instructions and task prompt; only an appended evidence block differs.": "所有证据都来自每个训练 issue 的已验证修复，不用任何外部模型生成内容。教师的提示词与学生共用同样的系统指令和任务提示，区别只在末尾附加的证据块。",
 "Stage": "阶段",
 "What the teacher sees": "教师看到的内容",
 "Added tokens, median / mean": "新增 token 数（中位数 / 均值）",
 "changed non-test file paths, old-side hunk ranges and the pre-patch source lines, but not the replacement code": "改动的非测试文件路径、旧版本一侧的 hunk 范围和修改前的源代码行，不含替换后的代码",
 "fail-to-pass test identifiers and names, reference test code, candidate test changes when available": "fail-to-pass 测试的标识符和名称、参考测试代码，以及候选测试改动（如有）",
 "the verified repair diff": "已验证的修复 diff",
 "all three (unrouted)": "三者全部（不做路由）",
 "the union, as a full-reference teacher would see it": "三者的并集，也就是完整参考教师看到的内容",
 "Climbing in repair order": "按修复顺序逐级训练",
 "Training runs 70 iterations in three phases, each continuing from the previous checkpoint: 30 for LOC, then 20 for REP, then 20 for PATCH. In each phase, the teacher, a frozen copy of the base checkpoint, is conditioned on that phase's evidence, and a top-16 token-level distillation loss is applied only to response tokens labelled with the active stage, with weight λ = 0.15. GRPO stays active on every valid response token throughout. The order follows how a repair uses the evidence: on-policy distillation only supervises states the student actually reaches, so patch evidence helps only once the student can find the code to change, and the reproduction script is what it later runs to check its patch.": "训练共 70 轮迭代，分三个阶段，每个阶段从上一阶段的检查点接着训：LOC 30 轮，REP 20 轮，PATCH 20 轮。每个阶段里，教师是基座检查点的冻结副本，以该阶段的证据为条件；top-16 的 token 级蒸馏损失只作用于标为当前阶段的回复 token，权重 λ = 0.15。GRPO 全程作用于所有有效回复 token。这个顺序对应修复过程使用证据的方式：on-policy 蒸馏只监督学生实际到达的状态，学生要先能找到该改的代码，补丁证据才派得上用场；复现脚本则是学生之后检查补丁时要运行的。",
 "All methods start from Qwen3-4B-Instruct-2507 without task-specific supervised fine-tuning and train on 1,149 issues from SWE-smith, SWE-ReBench, R2E-Gym and SWE-Gym, with 16 tasks × 4 rollouts per iteration. We evaluate on the 500 issues of SWE-bench Verified, under the R2E-Gym scaffold and the OpenHands scaffold.": "所有方法都从 Qwen3-4B-Instruct-2507 出发，不做针对任务的监督微调，在来自 SWE-smith、SWE-ReBench、R2E-Gym 和 SWE-Gym 的 1,149 个 issue 上训练，每轮迭代 16 个任务 × 4 条 rollout。评测用 SWE-bench Verified 的 500 个 issue，分别在 R2E-Gym 和 OpenHands 两种框架下运行。",
 "<b>Figure 2.</b> Results on two agent scaffolds (paper Table 2). <i>env_done</i> is the share of trajectories that finish before the resource limit; for average steps, lower is better. The dashed line marks the base model. GRPO+OPSD and SDAR use the same full-patch evidence as each other.": "<b>图 2.</b> 两种智能体框架下的结果（论文表 2）。<i>env_done</i> 指在资源上限之前跑完的轨迹占比；平均步数越低越好。虚线标出基座模型。GRPO+OPSD 和 SDAR 使用的完整补丁证据相同。",
 "<strong>On R2E-Gym, SWE-Ladder reaches 16.4% pass@1, against 10.4% for GRPO and 12.4% for GRPO+OPSD.</strong> It also takes fewer steps than the base model, 19.3 against 26.5, and completes 98.6% of its trajectories, whereas GRPO completes only 36.0% before the resource limit. SDAR, a gated distillation method given the same patch evidence, falls to 4.6%. On OpenHands, the three baselines end at or below the base model's 13.0% (GRPO 11.2%, GRPO+OPSD 12.4%, SDAR 6.8%), while SWE-Ladder reaches 17.6% with 16.6 steps and 99.4% completion.": "<strong>在 R2E-Gym 上，SWE-Ladder 的 pass@1 达到 16.4%，GRPO 为 10.4%，GRPO+OPSD 为 12.4%。</strong>它的平均步数也比基座模型少（19.3 对 26.5），98.6% 的轨迹能跑完；GRPO 在资源上限之前只跑完了 36.0%。SDAR 是一种带门控的蒸馏方法，拿到同样的补丁证据，结果降到 4.6%。在 OpenHands 上，三个基线最终都不高于基座模型的 13.0%（GRPO 11.2%，GRPO+OPSD 12.4%，SDAR 6.8%），SWE-Ladder 则达到 17.6%，平均 16.6 步，完成率 99.4%。",
 "<span class=\"n\">4</span>What changes along the ladder": "<span class=\"n\">4</span>逐级训练中的能力变化",
 "We evaluate the checkpoint at the end of each phase, LOC30, REP50 and PATCH70, and track the three behaviours together with pass@1 (<a class=\"fig-ref\" href=\"#fig-3\">Figure 3</a>). <strong>The LOC phase improves all four. The REP phase keeps improving localization, but reproduction and verification fall below the base model. The PATCH phase recovers both, and PATCH70 ends above the base model on all four metrics</strong>, the only method in the comparison to do so.": "我们评测每个阶段结束时的检查点 LOC30、REP50 和 PATCH70，同时跟踪三种行为和 pass@1（<a class=\"fig-ref\" href=\"#fig-3\">图 3</a>）。<strong>LOC 阶段让四项指标都有提升。REP 阶段继续提升定位，但复现和验证跌到基座模型以下。PATCH 阶段把这两项拉了回来，PATCH70 最终在四项指标上都超过基座模型</strong>，是对比方法中唯一做到这一点的。",
 "R2E-Gym, end of each phase": "R2E-Gym，各阶段结束时",
 "Change from the base model (percentage points)": "相对基座模型的变化（百分点）",
 "<b>Figure 3.</b> Localization, reproduction, verification and pass@1 at the base model and at the end of each phase (paper Figure 7). Base values are 33.6%, 59.4%, 22.6% and 9.6%; hover a point for the absolute value. Step through the checkpoints or press play to climb the ladder.": "<b>图 3.</b> 基座模型及各阶段结束时的定位、复现、验证和 pass@1（论文图 7）。基座模型的四项数值分别为 33.6%、59.4%、22.6% 和 9.6%；悬停在数据点上可查看绝对值。可以逐个切换检查点，也可以点播放按钮逐级查看。",
 "<span class=\"n\">5</span>What matters": "<span class=\"n\">5</span>哪些设计起作用",
 "<strong>Every stage contributes, and routing alone is not enough.</strong> Removing LOC, REP or PATCH from the schedule lowers pass@1 from 16.4% to 11.2%, 13.2% or 14.0%, and every such variant falls below the base model on reproduction and verification. Removing LOC hurts most, consistent with localization being the stage the others build on. Training all three stages at once, with each routed token subset distilled from its own evidence but without the order, reaches only 12.4% and loses reproduction (35.6%) and verification (12.6%).": "<strong>每个阶段都有贡献，只做路由不够。</strong>从训练计划中去掉 LOC、REP 或 PATCH，pass@1 分别从 16.4% 降到 11.2%、13.2% 和 14.0%，而且这些变体的复现和验证都低于基座模型。去掉 LOC 影响最大，这与定位是其他阶段的基础相符。三个阶段同时训练时，每个路由出的 token 子集仍用各自的证据蒸馏，只是不分先后，结果只有 12.4%，复现（35.6%）和验证（12.6%）也都下降。",
 "Stage ablation, R2E-Gym": "阶段消融，R2E-Gym",
 "<span><i id=\"f4-key\" style=\"background:var(--loc)\"></i><span id=\"f4-name\">SWE-Ladder</span></span><span><i style=\"background:none;border:1.5px solid var(--b-ink);border-radius:2px;width:9px;height:9px\"></i>full SWE-Ladder, for reference</span>": "<span><i id=\"f4-key\" style=\"background:var(--loc)\"></i><span id=\"f4-name\">SWE-Ladder</span></span><span><i style=\"background:none;border:1.5px solid var(--b-ink);border-radius:2px;width:9px;height:9px\"></i>完整 SWE-Ladder（作参照）</span>",
 "<b>Figure 4.</b> Stage ablation (paper Table 3). Each variant drops one stage from the schedule, or trains all three at once; outlines mark the full SWE-Ladder. Only the full ladder improves all four metrics.": "<b>图 4.</b> 阶段消融（论文表 3）。每个变体从训练计划中去掉一个阶段，或把三个阶段放在一起同时训练；虚线框表示完整的 SWE-Ladder。只有完整的阶梯在四项指标上都有提升。",
 "<strong>The order matters.</strong> With the same 30/20/20 budget, reversing the order (PATCH → REP → LOC) gives 11.4%, and putting reproduction first (REP → LOC → PATCH) gives 12.6%, even though PATCH is still last. Both also take more steps. <strong>The evidence must match the stage it supervises:</strong> with a 30-iteration budget, supervising LOC tokens with LOC evidence gives 14.4%, against 13.6% with patch evidence; supervising PATCH tokens with patch evidence gives 13.2%, against 11.8% with localization evidence, which reveals too little to write a fix.": "<strong>顺序很重要。</strong>同样按 30/20/20 分配迭代轮数，把顺序反过来（PATCH → REP → LOC）只有 11.4%；先训练复现（REP → LOC → PATCH）为 12.6%，尽管 PATCH 仍在最后。这两种顺序的步数也更多。<strong>证据必须与它监督的阶段对应：</strong>在 30 轮迭代的预算下，用 LOC 证据监督 LOC token 得到 14.4%，换成补丁证据为 13.6%；用补丁证据监督 PATCH token 得到 13.2%，换成定位证据为 11.8%，因为定位证据透露的信息太少，不足以写出修复。",
 "Training order, 70 iterations": "训练顺序，70 轮迭代",
 "Evidence vs supervised stage, 30 iterations": "证据与被监督阶段，30 轮迭代",
 "<b>Figure 5.</b> <b>Left:</b> three stage orders with the same budget (paper Table 4); average steps per trajectory are shown under each bar. <b>Right:</b> matched against swapped evidence for LOC and PATCH targets (paper Table 5).": "<b>图 5.</b> <b>左：</b>相同预算下的三种阶段顺序（论文表 4），柱子下方标出每条轨迹的平均步数。<b>右：</b>LOC 和 PATCH 目标分别使用对应证据与互换证据的结果（论文表 5）。",
 "<span class=\"n\">6</span>Training dynamics": "<span class=\"n\">6</span>训练动态",
 "Comparing the first and last ten iterations, GRPO's optimization signals deteriorate: mean entropy falls from 0.0300 to 0.0061, gradient norm from 1.820 to 0.187 and training reward from 0.236 to 0.055, while responses nearly double in length, from 8.29k to 16.73k tokens. SWE-Ladder stays steadier: entropy 0.0251 → 0.0221, gradient norm 2.353 → 2.397, and responses grow modestly from 10.09k to 11.62k tokens. GRPO+OPSD and SDAR also keep optimization signal late in training, so preserved entropy or gradient magnitude alone does not explain SWE-Ladder's held-out results. These are single runs without independent seeds.": "对比前 10 轮和最后 10 轮迭代，GRPO 的优化信号明显变差：平均熵从 0.0300 降到 0.0061，梯度范数从 1.820 降到 0.187，训练奖励从 0.236 降到 0.055，回复长度却几乎翻倍，从 8.29k 增加到 16.73k token。SWE-Ladder 更稳定：熵 0.0251 → 0.0221，梯度范数 2.353 → 2.397，回复长度只从 10.09k 小幅增加到 11.62k token。GRPO+OPSD 和 SDAR 在训练后期同样保留了优化信号，所以熵或梯度幅值没有衰减，本身并不能解释 SWE-Ladder 在留出集上的结果。以上均为单次运行，没有用不同随机种子重复。",
 "First → last 10 iterations": "前 10 轮 → 最后 10 轮",
 "Entropy": "熵",
 "Gradient norm": "梯度范数",
 "Response tokens": "回复 token 数",
 "Training configuration, reward shaping and the full evidence examples are in the <a class=\"tx\" href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.33667\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">paper</a>.": "训练配置、奖励设计和完整的证据样例见<a class=\"tx\" href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.33667\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">论文</a>。",
 "A student robot climbs a ladder with LOC, REP and PATCH rungs toward a green check mark, while a frozen teacher robot holds up only a failing-test card; the localization card and a face-down patch card wait at its feet": "学生机器人沿着标有 LOC、REP、PATCH 三级横档的梯子爬向绿色对勾；冻结的教师机器人只举着一张失败测试卡片，定位卡片和一张背面朝上的补丁卡片放在它脚边",
 "Router state": "路由器状态",
 "Training phases": "训练阶段",
 "Scaffold": "智能体框架",
 "Checkpoint": "检查点",
 "Variant": "变体"
}